flowchart TD
  modules[Browser modules]
  askchat[Ask in Chat link]
  routes[Route table]
  exec[Exec route]
  handlers[REPL command handlers]
  manager[IndexManager]
  runner[Chat runner]
  askai[ask-ai command]
  overview[Overview by AI]
  handle[handleTool]
  tools[TOOLS table]
  mcpproc[MCP server process]
  external[External MCP clients]
  llm[LLM engines]

  modules -->|fetch api endpoints| routes
  askchat -->|prefills; a person sends| modules
  modules -->|Console tab| exec
  exec -->|not through handleTool| handlers
  routes -->|gets the active index| manager
  manager -->|setIndex pushes the index| handle
  routes -->|chat routes| runner
  askai -->|same loops| runner
  routes -->|Overview by AI route| overview
  runner -->|tool calls in-process| handle
  overview -->|local: in-process| handle
  overview -->|cloud: stdio child| mcpproc
  external -->|stdio child process| mcpproc
  mcpproc -->|loads its own index| handle
  runner -->|model turns| llm
  overview -->|model turns| llm
  tools -->|all, or 8 for local| runner
  tools -->|16 tools| overview
  tools -->|all tools| mcpproc

%% tip: TOOLS table :: One table, three menus: all tools, 16 for the overview, 8 for a local model.
%% tip: handleTool :: One router for model tool calls. The Console's exec route does not use it.
%% tip: Ask in Chat link :: Only fills in the Chat box. A person still presses Enter.
%% tip: Chat runner :: On a local model it adds GGUF-specific handling: see its detail.
